/A 1986 0 R
/Alt (Eight-panel scientific figure presenting various optimization and calibration results for hydrogen storage modeling. Panels \(a\) and \(b\) show line graphs of temperature versus time for different heat transfer coefficients and pressures, respectively, both incorporating adaptive optimization strategies. Panels \(c\) and \(d\) depict hydrogen release rate \(fraction X\) versus time, highlighting effects of adaptive optimization and pressure. Panel \(e\) compares time-to-threshold t_d among materials and models, while \(f\) displays surrogate performance improvements as percentage reduction. Panel \(g\) plots surrogate and PDE-simulated hydrogen release histories for materials, and \(h\) provides a scatter plot parity check between target and PDE-calculated t_d.)
/ID (ID.01138)
/K 1987 0 R
/P 16 0 R
