/A 2027 0 R
/Alt (Four-panel scientific figure. Panel \(a\) shows a line graph comparing normalized objective versus generation for fixed differential evolution \(dashed black\) and self-adaptive DE \(magenta\), with self-adaptive DE outperforming in most runs. Panel \(b\) presents a line graph of porosity \(solid blue\) and CuCr1Zr fraction \(dashed red\) as functions of normalized coordinate, displaying sharp transitions at the wall-zone boundary. Panel \(c\) displays an optimized transient schedule, plotting heat transfer coefficient \(blue dashed\) and pressure \(solid red\) over time, with step changes at specified values. Panel \(d\) compares optimized responses, plotting X\(t\) versus time for multiple benchmarks, indicating faster response for PG-SADE-GHF \(magenta\).)
